panel paslanmaz (4951.75, 1676.75, 1158.0) (5034.25, 1759.25, 1188.0)\r\nQR panel kablosu x 4720 r 2.5: ucu z 1163 -> 1173\r\nQR panel kablosu x 4880 r 2.5: ucu z 1143 -> 1138\r\nQR panel kablosu x 4735 r 3.0: ucu z 1163 -> 1173\r\nQR panel kablosu x 4895 r 3.0: ucu z 1143 -> 1138\r\neski bulasik hat_elektrik (nis duvarina) sil 59\r\ntezgah bina hatti: 2 gomme buat + rakor, kablo EIL3 [(3232.0, -60.0, 1135.0), (3232.0, 760.0, 1135.0)] · MEIKO [(3232.0, -60.0, 1795.0), (3232.0, 60.0, 1795.0), (3232.0, 60.0, 1828.0), (3245.0, 60.0, 1828.0)]\r\nevye dolabi tabani kablo deligi 13 x 13 duzlemler [100.0, 101.2]\r\nzemin doseme yeniden (delik 7): ucgen 274\r\nyazildi a3.glb","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"959d41b2-f8c0-4ef1-920c-ab06627db236","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:22:57.876Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"11311ecd-44c4-4f30-8138-3a698c40f0b5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
