\\|Ana pano\\|B/Elektrik\"","description":"Build parts cache for final GLB","timeout":600000}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfg1wFYeKAVa2KSEm7csS","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"6451cc99-5fe0-44c1-9514-ae84664b880e","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:30:59.031Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"6451cc99-5fe0-44c1-9514-ae84664b880e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"58bff7e7-f337-49d0-8e79-c70c4b163856","agentId":"a93ea3e059d5c65dd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YRC7Kgr4vEzJgorkkDxgNc","type":"tool_result","content":"1623968 ucgen 4560 parca 40 gizli prim\r\nTOPPING/Hava                    66    8129 [1587, 1082, -809] [2492, 1666, -630]\nF/Hava                          26    7141 [2436, 1348, -812] [4464, 1860, -80]\nB/Elektrik                     162   46888 [799, -15, -828] [4392, 745, -53]\nU/Havalandırma                  14    1232 [2578, 1868, -828] [3922, 2138, -778]\nQR/Elektrik                    133   36343 [4374, -15, 672] [5227, 2042, 1173]\nQR/Gövde                        19    2042 [4370, 0, 670] [5230, 2050, 1190]\nQR/Gözler                      260    6528 [4390, 450, 672] [5202, 1650, 1190]\nElektrik/Ana pano              156  324970 [3505, 1864, -850] [3988, 2176, -53]\nTezgâh/Gövde                    42    1848 [3200, -80, 1038] [3893, 1700, 1874]\nK/Hava                          50    7513 [4008, 991, -818] [4398, 1813, -150]\nE/Hava                           4     966 [4408, 1018, -767] [5052, 1624, -538]\nQR/Robot kutusu (rezerv)         1      22 [4395, 20, 675] [4870, 443, 943]\nQR/Müşteri paneli                3      36 [4628, 1658, 1138] [5034, 1778, 1188]\nTezgâh/Bulaşık makinesi         22    1513 [3217, -60, 1408] [3878, 700, 1868]\nTezgâh/Evye                     21    1544 [3217, -60, 1039] [3838, 1594, 1402]\nÇevre/Dükkân hattı              18    5308 [3934, -120, -850] [4845, 2126, 1075]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1216e4ea-2b37-48ea-86c6-b7de163bd6e7","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:31:03.455Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6451cc99-5fe0-44c1-9514-ae84664b880e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1